ound hover:text-primary transition-all duration-300 inline-block font-bold uppercase tracking-widest\" href=\"/build-the-night\">Build the Night</a></li><li><a class=\"text-xs text-muted-foreground hover:text-primary transition-all duration-300 inline-block font-bold uppercase tracking-widest\" href=\"/card-games\">Date-night Card Game · 18+</a></li><li><a class=\"text-xs text-muted-foreground hover:text-primary transition-all duration-300 inline-block font-bold uppercase tracking-widest\" href=\"/concierge\">Event Concierge</a></li><li><a class=\"text-xs text-muted-foreground hover:text-primary transition-all duration-300 inline-block font-bold uppercase tracking-widest\" href=\"/guides/how-much-alcohol-for-a-party\">Party Drinks Guide</a></li><li><a class=\"text-xs text-muted-foreground hover:text-primary transition-all duration-300 inline-block font-bold uppercase tracking-widest\" href=\"/contact\">Support</a></li></ul></div><div class=\"lg:col-span-1\"><h4 class=\"text-[10px] font-black text-foreground mb-6 uppercase tracking-[0.2em]\">Logistics</h4><ul class=\"space-y-3\"><li><a class=\"text-xs text-muted-foreground hover:text-primary transition-all duration-300 inline-block font-bold uppercase tracking-widest\" href=\"/track\">Live Tracking</a></li></ul></div><div class=\"lg:col-span-1\"><h4 class=\"text-[10px] font-black text-foreground mb-6 uppercase tracking-[0.2em]\">Partners</h4><ul class=\"space-y-3\"><li><a class=\"text-xs text-muted-foreground hover:text-primary transition-all duration-300 inline-block font-bold uppercase tracking-widest\" href=\"/affiliate/register\">Become an Affiliate</a></li><li><a class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-xs text-muted-foreground hover:text-primary transition-all duration-300 font-bold uppercase tracking-widest\" href=\"/merchant/onboarding\">Become a Merchant</a></li><li><a class=\"text-xs text-muted-foreground hover:text-primary transition-all duration-300 inline-block font-bold uppercase tracking-widest\" hr